<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">RRK64.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">2 YOHAANA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebaruha ya Kabiri eyaahandiikirwe Yohaana</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Yohaana</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">EBARUHA YA KABIRI EYAAHANDIIKIRWE</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOHAANA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1" />Nyowe nk'omukuru naakuhandiikira, iwe Omuzaire owaatoorainwe n'abaana baawe, abu ndikukunda omu mazima, kandi tiinye nyenka kureka n'abandi boona abarikumanya amazima, <verse eid="2JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2" />ahabw'amazima agatuura omuriitwe, kandi agariguma naitwe ebiro byona; <verse eid="2JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3" />embabazi n'okusaasira n'obusingye ebirikuruga ahari Ruhanga Isheboona na Yesu Kristo Omwana we, biryaguma naitwe omu mazima n'okukunda.<verse eid="2JN 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4" />Nkashemererwa munonga ahakuba nkashanga abamwe aha baana baawe nibagyendera omu mazima nk'oku twaragiirwe Isheboona. <verse eid="2JN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:7">1 Yoh 2:7</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu ninkweshengyereza, Muzaire, ntari nk'orikukuhandiikira ekiragiro kisya, kureka ekyo eki tushangirwe twine okwiha iranaira, ekituragiira ngu tukundane. <verse eid="2JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6" />Kandi oku nikwo kukunda, itwe okugyendera omu biragiro bye. Eki nikyo kiragiro, nk'oku mwahuriire okuruga iranaira, ngu mube nikyo mwagyenderamu. <verse eid="2JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:18">1 Yoh 2:18</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba hariho abarikuhabisa baingi abaizire omu nsi, abatarikwikiriza ngu Yesu Kristo akaija aine omubiri. Orikugamba atyo n'omuntu orikuhabya abandi, kandi ni antikristo. <verse eid="2JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:11">Gal 4:11</ref>. </char></note> Mwerinde, mutafeerwa eki mwakoreire, kureka muheebwe ekihembo ekihikire. <verse eid="2JN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9" />Omuntu weena orikurenzya aha nyegyesa ya Kristo atagigumiremu, naaba ataine Ruhanga; orikugumira omu nyegyesa egyo, ogwo naaba aine Isheboona kandi n'Omwana. <verse eid="2JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 3:6">2 Tes 3:6</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu weena ku ariija ahi muri, ataine nyegyesa egyo mutarimutaasya omu nju, n'obu kwakuba okumuramutsya; <verse eid="2JN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11" />ahakuba orimuramutsya, aryaba akwataniise nawe omu micwe ye emibi.<verse eid="2JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12" />N'obu ndaabe nyine bingi kubahandiikira, kwonka tindikusiima kubihandiikisa bwino aha rupapura; ahakuba nyine amatsiko kwija okwo kugaaniira naimwe nitureebana, tubone kuhitsya okushemererwa kwaitu. <verse eid="2JN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13" />Abaana ba murumuna waawe baakuramutsya.<verse eid="2JN 1:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1" />
</usx>